{"articleNo":"80237","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=80237&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"해외탐방프로젝트(Pride of Korea) 대학생 모집안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.03.21","hit":"7657","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">일본 속 한국문화재 탐방 프로젝트, ‘Pride of Korea’ 참여 대학생 모집 공고</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"가. 제목\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"가. 제목\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">일본 속의 한국 문화재를 탐방할 수 있는 기회</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">를 제공함으로써, 우리 문화유산</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">에</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">대한 관심과 올바른 역사인식을 일깨워 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">대한민국에 대한 자부심을 갖춘 인재를 육성</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">하기 위한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">해외 탐방형 프로그램</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">「Pride of Korea」</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">에 열의가 있는 대학생 여러분의</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 많은 참여 부탁드립니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013년 3월 20일</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">한국장학재단 이사장</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 2.82pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 사업 소개</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대학생이 7월초 일본 오사카/교토/나라 지역의 대한민국 문화재를 탐방한 후, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">콘</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">텐츠</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제작 및 홍보를 통해 우리 문화재의 우수성을 널리 알리는 역할을 수행</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">함으로서 올바른 역사인식을 갖춘 대한민국 성공 인재로 양성될 수 있도록 지원하는 인재육성지원 사업</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 525px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 468px; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 28.99pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">항 목</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 28.99pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">내 용</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 28.99pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대 상</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 28.99pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 대학 재학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(휴학생 참여가능, 대학원생 신청불가)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 28.99pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">선발인원</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 28.99pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 100명 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(팀 또는 개인자격으로 신청 및 선발)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 44.59pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">탐방기간 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">및 지역</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 44.59pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 7월 초, 일본 오사카/나라/쿄토 탐방 예정</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.