 #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">사전설명회→탐방계획서 접수 및 SNS응원 등 심사</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">→선정팀 발표→출범식→일본탐방→시상</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 79.39pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">기타사항</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 79.39pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 한국장학재단(주최), KT&amp;G(주관), 문화재청(후원), 국외소재</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">문화재재단(후원)이 함께하는 프로그램으로서, 탐방후 콘텐츠에</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 대해 별도 시상 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></sp